    <string name="step_one_body" formatted="false">Vula Phequlula. Sesha noma faka ikheli lewebhusayithi. Ungakwazi futhi ukwabelana ngesixhumanisi sevidiyo kolunye uhlelo lokusebenza.</string>
    <string name="step_two_title" formatted="false">Zitholele umthombo</string>
    <string name="step_two_body" formatted="false">Dlala ividiyo, bese uthinta Thola amavidiyo. Khetha ifayela elitholiwe, noma namathisela isixhumanisi esiqondile sevidiyo ye-HTTPS.</string>
    <string name="step_three_title" formatted="false">Kwenze kube eyakho</string>
    <string name="step_three_body" formatted="false">Khetha igama lefayela, qinisekisa imvume yakho ukuze ulondoloze ividiyo, bese uthepha okuthi Landa. I-Android iqhubeka nokulanda ngemuva.</string>
    <string name="step_four_title" formatted="false">Jabulela iqoqo lakho</string>
    <string name="step_four_body" formatted="false">Vula Okulandiwe ukuze uhlole ukuqhubeka. Dlala noma wabelane ngamavidiyo aqediwe. Zama futhi ukulanda okuhlulekile ngesixhumanisi esisha lapho sidingeka.</string>
